== Trivia ==
* The first scenes in [[Endings|Ending 15]] and [[Endings|Ending 17]] show The Missing Poster pinned to a utility pole, with a silhouette of [[Mom|Isaac's mother]] who seems to be searching for Isaac in the background.
* There are many puzzle pieces in total. Assembling all of the jigsaw puzzles and figuring out what they meant was initially designed to be a collaborative effort of the community. As such, [[Edmund]] and [[Tyrone]] had openly expressed disappointment towards the datamining.<ref>"[https://youtu.be/UJVuLvGjPOc?t=8201 [Vinesauce&#93; Vinny - Interview with Edmund McMillen]" by Vinesauce: The Full Sauce; November 11, 2014.</ref>
* The unlock pop-up of Missing Poster calls it "Lost Poster". It is unknown if this is a mistake or a hint.
* A chest always containing the Missing Poster will appear as a room clear reward from the [[Dogma]] room, although it is impossible to access it without the use of [[Debug Console|console commands]].

